    fullMixedBirthOperationMultiplier n S B A Δ D steps code θ encode x p i = 1 :=
  birthForestOperationMultiplier_eq_one code (fullMixedIndexedBirthOwner S B steps) θ
    (fullMixedIndexedBirthPerformed n S B A Δ D steps x p)
    (fullMixedIndexedBirthValue n S B A Δ D steps encode x p) i hi

