/- The literal physical mark-state history satisfies the full-state energy
estimate after summing every physical list and bounded memory. This is an
unmasked chronological history; a separate whole-path constraint must still
be identified when applying it to the original physical sum. -/

namespace Bounty

section Physical
variable {I K : Type*} {N J ell B : ℕ} {P : Fin N → Finset ℕ}
