    physicalSmallBigPathVaryingGhostWeight n shared B A Δ D kbig ω μ qghost ρ
      Vedge Vedge Vs qsmall tag s e =
    physicalSmallBigPathEventWeight n shared B A Δ D kbig ω μ qghost ρ
      Vedge Vs qsmall tag s e := by
