    ((k,1),((1,1),(1,1))) hU hZ (by norm_num) (by norm_num) (by norm_num) ξ)
  simpa only [norm_mul, typeIICrossFourierPowers, typeIIPhase_norm, one_mul, mul_one,
    typeII_pulled_fourier_integrand_norm] using he

theorem typeII_cross_integral_le_of_harmonic_bound
